atch","merged_at":"2024-12-09T20:36:39Z"},"body":"This PR ensures the jittering is applied in a uniform manner across the whole viewport.\r\nPreviously, pixels ~closer to the center~ with farther Z used to get less jitter than those on the edge, as a side effect of perspective division.\r\n\r\nThis is achieved by jittering the near plane corners instead of the projection matrix, as only those are ultimately passed to embree in the end anyway.\r\n\r\nTest project : [occlusion_jitter.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17983531/occlusion_jitter.zip)\r\n\r\nThis improvement supersedes the fix in #99941.\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n|---|---|\r\n|![391694701-b5ee252d-38ba-4d0e-904b-fb8b7ee9ea80](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/902ad935-8c4d-4318-b2cc-d1d2e5b90bd0)|![output](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4be5d77e-5fd1-41e3-9585-ad6f15855ba5) |\r\n\r\n**Edit** : Resolves #53288 ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99974/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"c